sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: External-agent control and tool protocols
  accDescr: QAgents drives an external agent over ACP or the Devvi SDK. The external agent separately calls application tools using MCP, where host permissions and journaling apply.
  participant Lead as QAgents lead
  participant Agent as External agent
  participant Tools as QAgents MCP server<br/>(bound to a run)
  Note over Lead,Agent: CONTROL PLANE — ACP or Devvi SDK
  Lead->>Agent: Task + session + workspace
  Agent->>Lead: Steps + permission requests
  Lead->>Agent: Approval decision or cancel
  Note over Agent,Tools: TOOL PLANE — MCP
  Agent->>Tools: Typed tool call
  Note right of Tools: Check permissions<br/>Journal through supplied ctx
  Tools-->>Agent: Tool result
  Note over Lead,Agent: CONTROL PLANE
  Agent-->>Lead: Final answer + turn completion
